    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d134">

                <pb facs="0129" n="117" xml:id="pg117"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">884.796/13</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The British Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Halifax</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 913</seg>
                </opener>
                <p>His Majesty’s Ambassador presents his compliments to the Secretary of State, and
                    has the honour to refer to Mr. Hull’s note of October 22nd on the subject of
                    Article 11 (<hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>) of the Agreement of January 31st,
                    1942 between the United Kingdom and Ethiopia.</p>
                <p>Lord Halifax has been instructed to point out that negotiations leading to the
                    signature of this Agreement were started and practically completed before the
                    entry of the United States into the war. However, notwithstanding the terms of
                    paragraph (<hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>) of Article 11 of the Agreement, His
                    Majesty’s Government have no intention, when dealing with the question of
                    flights of United States aircraft across Ethiopia, of departing from the terms
                    of the Embassy <hi rendition="#italic">Aide-Mémoire</hi> of July 28th,
                        1942.<anchor n="44" xml:id="d134-f1"/> Furthermore they are prepared now and
                    at all times to facilitate as far as they can any United States air operations
                    which are necessary for the successful prosecution of the war.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1942-11-16">November 16,
                            1942</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
